        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A legend returns. The cold Red Wood stand unnervingly silent… yet something stirs beneath the stillness. Has he come back to life? Is the hunter once thought lost now stalking these woods again? Brace yourself: the forest remembers every secret, and this time, nothing will stay buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Stop in Red Wood recreates the feeling of survival horror with graphics inspired by the PS1 era, with the possibility of playing in fixed tank-style cameras and first-person camera. The game tries to follow an older graphic style with a mix of modern gameplay. The game contains hand-crafted cutscenes to give the story a more cinematic feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO RED WOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847330/extras/161b979720f52fe6a8a62b127d16d046.avif?t=1763748152\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p>",
